Welcome to Mr. Mix

Help to Mr. Mix help cook, write down the ingredients and he will prepare it for dinner.



Controls:

Just write the names of the ingredients with your Keyboard


Can you reach Level 6?



You need to install "dotNetFx45_Full_setup" and "xnafx40_redist" to play it! The files are in the folder. Just install it and have fun with the game.

